Lum: own start page (new tab), as in Lum Preview (docs/lum-ui-spec.md, "New tab").

The logo and a single field in the middle: a phrase is searched with Google, an address
opens the page. Polish UI in Polish, English otherwise. Uses the third-party new tab page
(chrome://new-tab-page-third-party) for every search engine, with its contents replaced.
No network requests. A new tab focuses this field instead of the address bar.

